MAIN
MOVE TEMP 8 8
MOVE TEMP 9 HALLOCATE TEMP 8
MOVE TEMP 0 TEMP 9
MOVE TEMP 10 8
MOVE TEMP 11 HALLOCATE TEMP 10
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 11
MOVE TEMP 12 TEMP 1
HSTORE TEMP 0 0 TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 13 ThisTest_ved_UseThis
HSTORE TEMP 1 0 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 ThisTest_ved_GetData
HSTORE TEMP 1 4 TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 15 0
MOVE TEMP 16 TEMP 15
HSTORE TEMP 0 4 TEMP 16
HLOAD TEMP 2 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 3 TEMP 2 0
MOVE TEMP 17 CALL TEMP 3 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 17
PRINT TEMP 4
END
ThisTest_ved_UseThis [ 1 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 18 100
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 0
MOVE TEMP 19 TEMP 2
HSTORE TEMP 3 4 TEMP 19
HLOAD TEMP 4 TEMP 0 0
HLOAD TEMP 5 TEMP 4 4
MOVE TEMP 20 CALL TEMP 5 ( TEMP 0 )
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 20
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 6
PRINT TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 21 0
MOVE TEMP 7 TEMP 21

RETURN TEMP 7
END
ThisTest_ved_GetData [ 1 ]
BEGIN
HLOAD TEMP 1 TEMP 0 4

RETURN TEMP 1
END

